# weltesche.thr  --  Anker (Claude Opus 5.5), 2026-10-25
# The World Ash as the kayon: the cycle's one great tree drawn as the wayang leaf-mountain,
# outline doubled. The bole parts round the table's mound -- the mound is the wound where Wotan
# cut his spear -- and one limb is a squared stub. Three roots; the last runs to the rim.
# one continuous line; rho<=0.95; Folio IX (Der Ring); house compass applied (+pi/2)
# geometry: true (compensated for the 19 mm rho-0 offset)
